- Bitter Triumph (1B) - removal/discard\n\
- Tersa Lightshatter (2R) in hand but not shown as playable yet\n\
\n\
I should play my land for turn. Since I have a Mountain and two Multiversal Passages, I should check which is best. Multiversal Passage enters tapped unless I control a Gate, and I don't have any Gates. So it would enter tapped. Mountain enters untapped. Playing Mountain gives me access to red mana for Tersa Lightshatter (2R) which could be useful next turn.\n\
\n\
I'll play the Mountain (p14) since it enters untapped and gives me more mana flexibility.\n\
\n\
